  "published": "2026-08-31T03:37:38.053Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.1.4:\n\n## Added\n- [PDF/A] Support for the PDF/A-4 conformance levels: the PdfA4, PdfA4e and PdfA4f members were added to the PdfAConformanceLevel enumeration. (DOC-7272)\n- [PDF/UA] Support for generating documents that comply with the PDF/UA-2 specification. (DOC-7272)\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Pdf.Annotations.Model3DAnnotation class: Represents a 3D annotation. (DOC-7577)\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Pdf.Annotations.Model3DView, Model3DViewCollection and Model3DStream classes: Represent the views and the 3D data of a 3D annotation. (DOC-7577)\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Pdf.Util.Matrix3D structure: Represents a 3D transformation matrix. (DOC-7577)\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Pdf.Structure.Namespace and NamespaceCollection classes: Represent the structure namespaces of a tagged PDF document. (DOC-7272)\n- StructTreeRoot.Namespaces property: Gets the collection of structure namespaces used in the document. (DOC-7272)\n- StructElement.NS property: Gets or sets the structure namespace of the structure element. (DOC-7272)\n- ContentItem.StructElement property: Gets the structure element that owns the content item. (DOC-7272)\n- Metadata.PdfRev and Metadata.PdfUaRev properties: Get or set the PDF and PDF/UA revision identifiers stored in the document metadata. (DOC-7272)\n- Overloads of the DestinationXYZ, DestinationFit, DestinationFitH, DestinationFitV, DestinationFitR, DestinationFitB, DestinationFitBH and DestinationFitBV constructors that accept a StructElement as the destination target. (DOC-7272)\n\n## Fixed\n- Various bug fixes and stability improvements.",
